WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:06.548
How do I

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:10.343
say goodbye

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:16.307
to what we had?

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:23.231
The good times that made us laugh

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:28.403
Outweigh the bad

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:33.241
…I thought we'd get

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:37.370
to see forever

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:43.960
But forever's gone away

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:50.341
It's so hard to say goodbye

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:55.346
to yesterday.

